Scientists have been ardently working on laser
technology for several decades. Directed light energy
became the object of intensive research which
eventually resulted in the creation of this battle
vehicle. Its creation is a direct consequence of the
need for a new weapon that uses something other
than conventional ammunition. Lasers seem to be very
effective against magic. Frequent break-downs and
drop-outs of this untested technology hinder the
usage of this weapon.~
